flowchart TB
    Pi[树莓派主控]
    Display[显示屏]
    Cam[摄像头]
    USB[USB麦克风/USB声卡]
    Speaker[扬声器]
    PCA[PCA9685舵机驱动板]
    ServoPower[外部舵机电源]
    BaseServo[底盘/头部舵机 Channel 0]
    LeftEar[左耳舵机 Channel 2]
    RightEar[右耳舵机 Channel 3]

    Pi -- HDMI/DSI --> Display
    Pi -- CSI/Camera --> Cam
    Pi -- USB --> USB
    USB -- Audio Out --> Speaker

    Pi -- 3.3V to VCC --> PCA
    Pi -- GND to GND --> PCA
    Pi -- GPIO2/SDA --> PCA
    Pi -- GPIO3/SCL --> PCA

    ServoPower -- V+ --> PCA
    ServoPower -- GND --> PCA
    Pi -- Common GND --> ServoPower

    PCA -- PWM/GND/V+ --> BaseServo
    PCA -- PWM/GND/V+ --> LeftEar
    PCA -- PWM/GND/V+ --> RightEar

    Note1[注意: 舵机动力电源接PCA9685 V+]
    Note2[注意: 树莓派3.3V只接PCA9685 VCC逻辑侧]
    Note3[注意: 树莓派/PCA9685/外部电源必须共地]
    Note1 -.-> ServoPower
    Note2 -.-> Pi
    Note3 -.-> PCA
